Author: clever-wolf-203 <clever-wolf-203@invalid>
Date:   Sun Nov 15 16:01:49 2026 +0000

    live_deploy: third read arm NoReadOfRecord, stated by the owning module
    
    Manager-accepted design fork (msg_a8f6dc52 item 3), with its conditions:
    
    - ArtifactReadSet gains NoReadOfRecord { reason }. The closure verdict maps it to Allowed: a unit that
      positively asserts it reads no installed artifact of record closes, and the deploy gate proceeds.
    - The arm is NEVER a default or fallback: it is only reachable where a kind's OWN module asserts a no-read
      with its OWN typed reason. The adapter's exhaustive match has a distinct arm per kind, so an unmodeled
      kind is structurally unable to borrow a no-read; it keeps its NotYetModeled arm and still halts.
    - TailscaleServeMapping is the first such kind: gunbc.tailscale_serve_scope owns the reason
      (tailscale_serve_mapping_no_read_reason) — a serve mapping is applied via the Tailscale serve CLI, so it
      reads no installed file. The adapter states no reason of its own; it calls the owner.
    - ArtifactInventoryRow gains NoReadRow { located, reason } so the no-read is countable and located
      (fail_closed: "every degradation is typed, located and countable").
    
    Controls (all PASS on base-matched seed sha256 900599bd...):
    - a_no_read_of_record_row_allows_the_deploy_gate: a lone NoRead row PROCEEDS (not secretly Unclosed).
    - no_read_is_never_a_fallback_for_an_unmodeled_kind: over the REAL srv1 roster, TailscaleServeMapping
      yields NoReadRow while DeployedTreeRemoteUnit (also unconditional, still unmodeled) yields UnclosedRow.
    - inventory_maps_every_row_to_derived_noread_or_unclosed: three-way mapping, NoRead located+reason non-empty.
    - reason_is_present extended; regressions a_fresh_host / roster / every_enabled_step green.
    
    Node: deploy-intent-owns-artifact-closure (node://adhoc-3e6e9bfb-d59).

